      "side": 1,
      "message": "What do you think about specifying these via cec_config? I.e.\n- Add an enum with values for the two timers (T1CNT1 and T1CNT2)\n- In board.c, specify the timer for each port in bitbang_cec_config.timer\n- In this file, add a static const struct array which maps the enum values to the values below\n- In the functions above, use cec_config[port]-\u003edrv_config-\u003etimer to index into the array. Similar to what I did on ITE: https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/chip/it83xx/cec_bitbang.c;l\u003d120\n\nJust a suggestion.",
      "range": {
